| ER-01 | Error | [Description] | Manual | | | |

**Priority definitions:**
- **P0**: Must pass to deploy. Blocks release.
- **P1**: Should pass. Can deploy with workaround.
- **P2**: Nice to have. Address post-launch.

**Test types:**
- Manual: Human-executed
- Automated: Unit/integration/E2E tests
- Performance: Load/stress testing
- Security: Vulnerability/penetration testing

### Exit Criteria

**Must have:**
- [ ] All P0 tests pass
- [ ] 90%+ of P1 tests pass (documented workarounds for failures)
- [ ] No open P0 security issues
- [ ] Performance meets SLA
- [ ] Critical integrations validated
- [ ] Error handling works as expected

**Issue severity:**
- **P0 (Critical)**: Blocks core functionality, data loss, security issue → Must fix
- **P1 (High)**: Major functionality impaired → Should fix
- **P2 (Medium)**: Minor issue, edge case → Can deploy with workaround
- **P3 (Low)**: Enhancement → Future release

